    {
      "source": "Types managed by a Spring Data implementation. Used to predefine a set of known entities that might need processing\nduring the initialization phase.",
      "translation": "由 Spring Data 实现管理的类型。用于在初始化阶段预先定义一组可能需要处理的已知实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dataProvider</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> used to lazily initialize the\n         <a href=\"ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a>; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>dataProvider</code> - 一个提供用于惰性初始化<a href=\"ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a>的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Iterable</code></a> 类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Supplier</code></a>；不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "new instance of <a href=\"ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a> initialized the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> of an\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.",
